        "message": "People: undergraduates show only their major under their name\n\nUnder an undergraduate's name the site now shows only their title and\nmajor (\"Lab manager\", \"EECS\"), or nothing until the major is known; never\n\"Undergraduate RA\". Graduate students keep \"PhD student, Economics\".\nApplies on People, project team lists and news.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
