        "message": "People: new members and photos; \"Graduate students\" group\n\n- Photos for Park Sinchaisri and William Deng; new members Zhiwei Wang\n  (PhD, Economics), Isabelle Cho and Jazz Beecham (lab managers), and\n  Nike Naiyarat, JJ Srimakut and Tom Jiramate (Chulalongkorn, '28).\n- PhD and master's students share one People group, \"Graduate students\";\n  cards keep the exact role.\n\nDECISIONS D-16.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
