        "message": "Home: the title and the pearl panel start on one line\n\nFrom 48rem the h1 heads the text column again and the pearl panel spans\nboth rows beside it; the h1's first line is trimmed to its cap height, so\nits capitals and the panel's top edge start on one line. From 80rem the\ntext column is 32rem wide, so the statement still sets in two lines.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
