        },
        "message": "Home: the first pearl, its label and the caption start on one line\n\nThe left pearl's dark disc, label and count now start exactly at the\ncaption's x (panel content edge + --pl-edge), and the right pearl mirrors\nit; the compact 2-column grid does the same. From 48rem the panel's top\nedge meets the cap height of the first line of text beside it. The panel\nclips its overflow so edge halos stay inside it.\n\nChosen by a workflow (3 readings of the owner's screenshots, 3 prototypes,\n3 judges; edge hug won 2-1) and verified to +-1px from 320 to 1920px,\nin WebKit, and on the n=2-8 fixture galleries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
