        "message": "simplify(integration): pearls change requests, D-15 gates and before/after sheets\n\nChange requests pearls-1..3 applied (Status marked in each):\n- pearls-1: the foundation morph test starts from a homepage pearl (.pl-link,\n  .pl-body named pearl-{slug}) instead of the removed cup.\n- pearls-2: the reduced-motion sampler hovers a homepage pearl and follows its\n  link again (the cup branch had been skipped silently); the people-page unit\n  test checks every fixture for no count line.\n- pearls-3: comments and ARCHITECTURE.md say \"homepage pearls\" / \"--tea panel\"\n  instead of \"cup\"; the session key bobalab-cup-intro is kept on purpose, so\n  the privacy page stays accurate.\n\nBefore/after sheets (live site vs the served simplify production export):\ndocs/simplify/after/d15-home-desktop.jpg, d15-home-mobile.jpg, d15-hover.jpg,\nd15-dark-desktop.jpg.\n\nGates (isolated-copy builds): typecheck, lint, format:check, unit 831 (+4\nskipped), validate 74, cms:check, media:check, check:export (production),\nperf, perf:assets, linkinator 0 broken; Playwright on the preview export\nChromium 226 / WebKit 223 passed, 0 failed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
