        "message": "simplify(home): restore the original pearl figure as the hero (D-15)\n\nThe boba cup is replaced by the original Fig. 1 pearl cluster (4740e10),\npolished per D-15: a flat --tea panel with an <ol> of real links, matte\nbodies with a direction-colour halo (shared with the direction header via\nhalo.css), hairline orbit and seeds, underlined labels and muted counts.\nPearlsIsland swaps the caption on hover/focus, dims only the other\npearls' graphics, tints the wordmark O and plays the settle-once intro.\nNo gloss, numerals, loops, parallax or Pause button. The homepage People\nsection drops its counts. src/components/cup is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
